WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:36.610
I'm Kurata Sana, first, year
middle school student!

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:40.530
I've been
waiting for this forever!

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.410
Hope there's good news.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.750
It's empty!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.090
No... Not again!

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.420
What is it?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:57.800
It's been a while but how come I
haven't received any news?!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.550
So what is it?

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.180
I probably...
didn't get selected.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.100
Didn't get selected,
what's wrong?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.180
I asked you what happened...

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.020
And over here at Fuka-chan's...

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:10.610
My feelings should be right,
the two of them...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.900
Last year, between them...

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:18.570
A lot of things happened but I think if they're fine now,

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:21.200
there should be no problem.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.580
Takaishi-kun...

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.540
Should I... give him a call?

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.920
The friend whom I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:36.010
This week's subject is the problem
which we neglected since.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:40.970
Back to Normal

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:46.470
I've talked to him because of
Sengoku-sensei and Hayama...

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.350
Yes! I use that as an excuse to
call him!

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:55.270
I'm so nervous!

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:56.980
Yes, Takaishi's residence.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.660
Um. This is Ma... Matsui Fuka.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:06.790
Oh, Fuka-chan! Haven't seen you in
a long time! How are you?

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.210
Yeah, a long time no see, um...

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:15.170
Ah... Yuuta is out with his friends.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.050
I'll have him call you back
when he gets home.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:23.720
It's really nothing important.
I'll call again some other time, bye.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:30.520
Yuuta is out with his friends.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.690
That's right, Takaishi-kun already has Shizu-chan.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:39.240
Yes! I finally had the courage to
call him!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.620
As I was saying,

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:49.200
luckily, it's on a school holiday, see...

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.790
So he's not with Shizu-chan,
but with these guys.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.420
Hmm? What are you looking at?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.750
Hey, Takaishi!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.670
What's up?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.340
No, nothing.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.470
- Nothing?
- Hey...

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.180
That girl who's sitting by the
window and gazing out at the streets.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.010
Hmm. I see. I see.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.350
What the heck, he was spacing out
just looking at her.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.640
No, I didn't!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.560
Don't' deny it.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.360
You broke up with Shizu-chan because
you just can't forget Matsui, am I right?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.740
Broke up?

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:22.150
Have you broken up with Shizu-chan?

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:24.660
You should give up on Matsui!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.240
Doesn't she already have
a boyfriend in Tokyo?

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.660
Ha... Hayama.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.830
If you continue to be so hung up
on her, you won't get a new girlfriend!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.290
Yep, yep, check this out.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.750
Teen Net's Valentine Event!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.710
There will be a lot of cute girls!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.470
I will get something out of this
year's event!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.180
I have to get a girlfriend!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.180
Valentine, pleased to meet you!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.680
Okay, that's it.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.980
What's Teen Net?

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.060
Did you remember Teen Net?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.190
It's a magazine targeted towards teenagers.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.360
It's the same magazine that featured Hayama and Fuka as best couple!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:05.400
Ah... I'm a useless man...

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.370
How can I tell Aya-chan...?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.830
Good morning, Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.410
Aya-chan, good morning...

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.160
What's wrong? Why in such a bad
mood so early in the morning?

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.460
To tell the truth, I don't think
I was chosen...

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.500
That Teen Net Valentine Event
that you always wanted go to...

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.970
Oh, that? Don't worry.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.550
Look, here's an invitation.
Free admission!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:29.220
You're so good, Aya-chan!
You got it!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.890
How many postcards
did you sent in?

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.390
Just one.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:34.810
Good morning, Aya-chan.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.560
Yo! Tsuyoshi, you don't seem well
this morning?

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.270
It's nothing.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:43.110
Aya-chan, are you two also going?
To the Teen Net Event?

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:44.320
You guys too?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.780
Yeah, just in case,
I sent in two postcards.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.950
And both of them were drawn!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:53.120
Almost everyone got selected.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.370
Not chosen.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:59.460
I mailed 117
and none of them were...

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.790
Have strength, Tsuyoshi!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.300
What you represent in life cannot
be decided by a raffle drawing.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.300
That's alright! I can just go
with Aya-chan!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.640
Aya-chan!
I'll stick with you forever!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.760
Tsuyoshi...

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.640
Time to lunch, Agency Babbit

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.640
Have lunch!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.890
Are you going to the Valentine
Event?

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.230
- I heard there's a game called
'Love at First Sight.' - It should be fun.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.570
Everyone's talking about it...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.360
The Valentine Event would be an
excellent chance for people who have no love.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.700
Can I sit here?

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.950
Please do.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.200
Oh. Fuka-chan, you'll come, right?
To the Teen Net Event.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.490
Teen Net...?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.540
Speaking of Teen Net... it reminds
me of that photo...

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.460
That one? It's this photo.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.920
Fuka and Hayama, already broke up.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.380
We shouldn't have brought it up...

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.680
Let's go together, Fuka-chan!

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.010
Stop it! Stop talking, Sae-chan!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.800
What's wrong with you, Aya-chan?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.810
Aya-chan, I see. Do you think this will hurt my feelings?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:02.060
Don't worry about me, I'm not that
hung up about the past.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:06.030
To wipe away the past,
I'll go happily!

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.490
And find a new boyfriend!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.860
- Alright!
- I guess so.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.820
Hey, Fuka!
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:15.160
Excuse me.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.870
Sana-chan, are you going
to the Valentine Event?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.330
Valentine? Is it on February 14th?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.580
That's right.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.420
It's too bad,
I have to film that day.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.760
Used to be Kodomo no Omocha,
now simplified as Kodocha!

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.260
Still partnered with Zenjiro-san?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.760
Similar to the one before?

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.720
Pretty much,
but a new section is added.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:39.180
We were so bored
ever since Kodocha ended.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.890
Huh? Akito-kun!

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.230
Akito-kun, are you going
to the Valentine Event?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.820
Valentine Event, is it?

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.240
What's the point of that,
Hayama?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.030
So I see.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.450
You think Take like going to those
meat market events?

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:59.200
Th... that's right, your advancement
test is coming up.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.620
Eh? Are you taking the advancement test?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.090
Yeah, I'm gonna try this time.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.050
Well, try to work hard.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.010
Sure, you too, study, hard.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.970
- Okay!
- Are you alright, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.970
The two seem to have a fairly
superficial relationship.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.440
But I think it's natural.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:28.320
Tsuyoshi-kun, I already prepared
Valentine's chocolate.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.740
- Aya-chan...
- Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.870
What a strong contrast compared go
that other couple...

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.240
Hmm? Chocolate...

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.420
I couldn't help but buy this...

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.630
Since chocolate was given as a
friend, I'll mail it with the voice message.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.680
All right!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.050
This is a friendship chocolate.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.100
This is a friendship chocolate.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:06.400
Takaishi-kun... Takaishi-kun...

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.690
Don't take him away...

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.570
I still... can't.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.950
I knew I wasn't supposed to,
what was I thinking?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:25.290
That means...
I shouldn't call him either.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.960
Te... telephone.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.720
- Yes.
- Fuka.

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.720
Taka... ishi-kun?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.600
Yeah, my mom said you called earlier.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:50.610
Yeah, last time, about Hayama...

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.530
It's alright now...
so I wanted to tell you.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.780
That's good. That guy always sits
idle and enjoys the results of others' work.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.490
Eh? I...

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:08.120
Oh yeah, I'm going to Tokyo with
my friends next Saturday.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.590
For that Teen Net Valentine Event.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.920
I... I'm going too!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.170
Really?

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.630
Really, really?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.140
Then I'll be able to see you at
the event.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.430
Ah... that's right...

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.890
Takaishi-kun
and Shizu-chan...

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.520
Fuka and... Hayama...

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.400
Hello? Takaishi-kun?

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.530
- Actually...
- What is it?

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.110
Actually, Shizu and I...

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:40.610
Ah, another phone call.

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.870
Sorry, I'll hang up an call you
again later.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.630
Broke up...

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.130
What was I going to say?

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:59.260
It's too late now...

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:03.550
She already has Hayama...

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.770
Yes. Sorry for handing up
in the middle.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.860
What did you want to tell me?

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:16.940
No, nothing.
That's about it.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.160
Okay... bye...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:39.550
{parte b}

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:52.100
(Babiley Group,) ukulele

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.220
Want to write love letter to the love.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.390
But still don't deciding whether write.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.900
Didn't know that another boy,

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.110
suddenly revealed his love to me.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:59.610
Even if it isn't him, but it's alright.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.860
Isn't it, isn't it, isn't it alright too?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.450
A life like this isn't too bad other?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:11.080
The long awaited new feature in
Kodocha...

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.330
...is named 'The Always Willing
Trouble Helpers'!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.670
Huh? The Always Willing Trouble
Helpers?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.630
All OK? What kind of name is that?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:20.920
It's alright.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:26.600
It's about Zenjiro-san and Sana-chan helping people who seek for help.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:30.390
I think I've seen a similar
feature before!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.430
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:37.690
No, what we have in mind is
sending Sana-chan and Zenjiro-san to the street

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.690
carrying a sign that says
'The Always Willing Trouble Helpers',

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.990
so it should be a fresh idea...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.530
The fist filming is February 14th,
Valentine Day.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.790
We wish to have romantic and
dramatic content as the main focus.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.960
We even prepared your costumes!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.920
Costumes? That'll be great!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:13:00.130
It will be the first time I've
ever portrayed a heroic figure, I'll be famous!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.720
Alright! We have to work hard,
Sana-chan!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:04.050
Yes, I will.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.930
Valentine's Day in English is...

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.510
- Saint Valentine's day.
- We should speak like this.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:13.060
Wh... what the heck is this?!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.770
The producer lied!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.480
Mine's cuter.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:23.070
Well, we need to use brilliant colors. They suit you very well.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.490
My dream of becoming a hero is over...

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.610
There, there.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.160
If we help people from the bottom
of our hearts...

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.080
...then we're the true heroes,
right?

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:37.000
That's right, just like you said.
I'll play my part and work hard!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.040
Yes, let's begin to screen

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.960
Bring camera to here.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.920
Welcome, everyone!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.420
This our first visit here.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.800
We're 'The Always Willing Trouble Helpers'!

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:52.350
If you have any troubles or
concerns, please tell us!

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.810
No way, they're ignoring us.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.060
ln the Valentine Event...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.980
Here is a sociable.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.650
Hey! Is everyone having fun?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:06.400
Lovers enjoy yourselves!
Single people do your best!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.820
Wow, there's a lot of people!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:13.330
Yeah, just as I thought, there's
a lot of girls, and guys!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:18.290
Takaishi-kun and Shizu-chan are
probably here, too.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.420
There are a lot of cute girls!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.880
Yeah, I know, we need to use this
chance wisely!

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.170
Fuka and Hayama are probably here, too.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.550
They miss each other

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.470
They care each other.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.220
Hey, let's get something to eat.

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.600
Good idea.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.720
I think... I should leave.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.190
Go home? Why all of a sudden?

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.980
Gymnastics...

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:43.230
I suddenly remembered that I had
gymnastics practice today.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.070
Takaishi, what's wrong?

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.610
I... I want to leave.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.240
Same thing over there.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.990
My club has very strict rules, so,
I'm sorry about today.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.750
Wait, Fuka-chan!

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.290
Wait a minute, Takaishi!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.500
But I...

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:02.420
What are you doing? We had to take the bullet train just to get here!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.050
Don't be a bad sport,
come with us!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.590
Fuka-chan!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.970
They missed

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.510
They need some time
for being together.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.840
I'm tired.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:14.470
We waited for an hour to get only
one customer.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.510
And it's...

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.100
Excuse me, my back itches,
will you scratch it for me?

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.020
This can't go on TV...!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.690
The first tape recording of
Kodocha is a failure!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.940
Isn't there anything that's worth
our time around here?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:32.360
There seems to be an event
going on near here.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.320
Hmm? Event...

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.080
Alright! Let's go!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.830
Event? Could it be...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.250
You got it!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.670
What happened to Fuka-chan?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.290
She left all of a sudden.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.420
She couldn't help it if there was
gymnastics practice.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.920
Hmm... That's true.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.930
Would you like you to go to the
'Love Fight' Cam with us?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.100
I'm sorry,
we already have other plans.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:57.640
Would you like to go to the 'Love
Love Fight' Cam with us?

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:00.060
We already have boyfriends.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.810
He looks sad.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.270
Over here too.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:10.150
There are too many girls here, can you find me some guys to come here?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.910
Okay, you can count me!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:15.780
Found me.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.240
This... this woman.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.750
It'd be troublesome
if she hooked me.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.670
Wait!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:26.540
Would you like to go to the
Valentine's Event?

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.170
We're a little short on guys.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.550
This is for you.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:35.470
There are a lot of fun games, free food and drinks, and lots of yummy stuff!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.140
Like pizza, sushi, and etc...

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.680
Sushi!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:43.520
Hayama, you are always defeated
when there's sushi.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.480
Yeah! Come over here and see!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.900
Wow, Hayama-san.
Tons and tons of girls.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:54.150
Akito-kun, didn't you say that you
don't like these meat market events?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.490
Really, really!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.330
Are you hungry, Hayama-kun?

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:00.790
Here's more sushi!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.080
- Wow! He's cool!
- Aya-chan.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.920
Eh? Isn't that Fuka's boyfriend?

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.590
Eh? Ha... Hayama.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.680
Becomes this in Takaishi's eyes.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.510
What's this guy doing?!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.260
Hey, Hayama! What are you doing?
Where's Fuka?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.060
You're... Takaishi.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.270
Aya-chan!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:26.020
What are you doing with this kind
of girl without Fuka being here?!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.900
This kind of girls?!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.440
Aya-chan is my grilriend!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.900
Then where's you girlfriend?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.490
It's none of your business!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.240
Then it's none of your business
either.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.320
What'd you say?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.780
Hey, everyone!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.490
Welcome!

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:45.000
We're 'The Always Willing Trouble Helpers'!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.620
It's Sana-chan...!

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.960
Sana-chan! Here, here!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.840
Aya-chan and Hisae-chan!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:52.550
Long time no see.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.800
You got here just in time.
Look over there.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.130
Huh? Hayama?

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:58.140
Oh? It's Kurata Sana!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.050
What's going on with that guy...?

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.390
Fuka-chan's ex-boyfriend is having
some misunderstanding with Hayama.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.190
That guy said Aya-chan was
'that kind of girl'!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:11.980
How did I get in here?

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.110
Aya-chan is my girlfriend!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.150
What a mess!

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:19.240
Please wait a second

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.110
If you haven't anything,
please stand back.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:25.830
So, in other words, you thought
Hayama was cheating on his girlfriend.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.120
Hmm... Yes...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:33.710
He probably didn't know that
Hayama-san and Matsui already broke up.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.550
Eh? Broke up?

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:39.760
Is that true, what he said?

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.140
Well, guess you still have
a chance!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.640
Hold on a sec!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.690
What chance?! You have a girlfriend,
don't you?! Fuka said...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.480
Eh? Where's Fuka?

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:55.690
You're too slow on the news!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.030
I... broke up with my ex-girlfriend.

00:19:01.370 --> 00:19:03.080
What did you say...?

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.790
We broke up.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:09.960
You did it because you couldn't forget the girl whom Hayama-kun broke up with, right?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.080
Or...

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:16.300
You are all alone then you may
tell her you love her.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:18.340
Love is a battlefield!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.720
When you fell, you get up, and get
stronger by learning from your mistakes!

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.850
I'm not bragging,

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:28.850
but take a look at my injured
heart!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:31.310
This is really something he
shouldn't brag about.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.110
Alright! Let's go find her!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:35.400
- Where's the girl right now?
- At school.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.480
Alright!
Head to the school!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.900
This is a great theme
for our program!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.280
Ah! You guys stop right here, so
things won't get even messier.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.700
I lied saying that I had
gymnastics practice,

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:52.000
come to think of it,
it was really not necessary.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.380
I'm an idiot,
I should just go home.

00:19:56.550 --> 00:20:00.380
'The Always Willing Trouble
Helpers' are here!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.890
Sana, you look like you're
going to a costume party.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:06.140
- Come with us!
- Yikes! Wait, what do you want?

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.850
Let me down!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.350
Takaishi-kun...

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:14.940
Fuka.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.650
Takaishi-kun, why are you here?

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.400
Fuka, I...

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.570
That's great,
get it at a good angle!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:25.700
Ee? Camera?
It's going to broadcast on TV?

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.160
That'll be terrible!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.370
Sana-chan!
Hurry and go stop them!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.750
If Sengoku-sensei knows about
this, Fuka'll die for sure!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.290
Eh? That'll be horrible!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.420
Stop! Stop! Don't record this!
You can't! You can't!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.670
Let go! Sana-chan!
Don't screw this up! No!

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.760
What is she doing?

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.600
That drumming sound...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:53.440
My memories of that terrifying
drumming sound...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.650
It can't be... It can't be...

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.700
Ykkes! It really is Sumira-chan!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.700
Hi! Zen-sama...

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.540
I wish to dance Valentine Limbo
with Zen-sama.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.210
Please help grant Sumira this w-i-s-h!

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.670
This might be good chance!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:21.590
Hey! Here's an excellent scene
 to record!

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:25.260
That's right, Valentine Limbo,
that's awesome!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.550
It's never wrong to grant the
audience's request.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.890
On Valentine's Day,
the separated lovers

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:33.100
were dramatically found again by
their fateful love.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.850
Wishing them a happy future,
Limbo of Love!

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.230
Zen-sama... come on!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:43.110
- Even I started dancing!
- It is pretty gorgeous!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:44.990
Zen-sama, let's limbo!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:47.570
Someone help me!

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.280
- Fuka.
- Yeah?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:55.000
I... broke up with Shizu.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:22:01.880
It might be useless to say this now, but, now I know that...

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:06.090
For me... only you...

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:08.550
only you exist.

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.480
Fuka?

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:19.310
I'm so happy... so very happy...

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:20.400
Fuka.

